{
	"name": "Trained Sapper",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/tools/hand/shovel-spade-steel-blue.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You gain a Burrow speed of 5ft. so long as you have a shovel or other digging implement ready. Using this form of movement, your tunnel is small sized, causing medium sized creatures to squeeze, but does not collapse immediately behind you. If you choose to use your action to dash, you can either burrow an additional 5ft or increase the size of your tunnel to allow medium sized creatures to not have to squeeze. In addition, you can clear rubble in half the normal time.</p>",
